  "instructions": [
    "Place the chicken (2 thighs and 2 legs), the whole onion, and the whole garlic cloves in a large pot with the 2 containers of chicken broth.",
    "Bring to a boil.",
    "Lower the flame, cover, and keep at a gentle bubble for 2 hours.",
    "Take the chicken out of the pot and let it cool. Add the vegetables (carrots, potatoes, celery, turnip, parsnip) and 1 cup of water, adding more to taste. Sprinkle with pepper, cumin, coriander, and a very little turmeric. Take the chicken off the bone, chop it up, and put it back in the pot.",
    "Bring back to a boil.",
    "Lower the flame and cook for 1 hour, adding the noodles 10-15 minutes before the hour is up."
  ],
